## Interface: 16001
## Title: Nameplates
## Notes: The game's nameplates in Sane UI's dress: a health bar with round corners, in your target's your combo points along its bottom, the name above it, your own debuffs and up to three of a foe's buffs, a mark on rares and the raid marker. Everything else of the game's plates stays as it is.
## Author: Saneroki
## Version: 0.3.0
## Category: Sane UI
## Group: SaneUI
## Dependencies: SaneUI
